        <p>Understanding the temporal profile of intranasal ketamine helps you plan your environment, your obligations, and your safety protocols. The timeline below assumes a moderate dose (4–6 sprays, 40–60 mg) of S-isomer ketamine in a 100 mg/mL formulation.</p>

